      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: None configured",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: AWS (account used for this project via `AWS_PROFILE=bidsenseai`), region eu-north-1 (org SCP restricts to eu-north-1 plus global services in us-east-1)",
