      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: bidsenseai-pro-documents (config-derived — not a confirmed upload destination; uploads of local data still require confirmation)",
      "**Key internal services**: RDS Data API (Aurora Serverless v2 PostgreSQL, single `pro` environment, accessed via HTTPS+IAM, no VPC/NAT); SQS (sqs.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com) for work queues; EventBridge Scheduler for triggers",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: `.env` / `.envrc` files (gitignored, local secrets); `infra/.terraform/terraform.tfstate` and `infra/bootstrap/.terraform/terraform.tfstate` (may embed resource identifiers/secrets); auction documents and extracted personal data (debtor names/addresses) under `document`/`extraction` tables and S3 `bidsenseai-pro-documents` — GDPR-sensitive, never published beyond what the product publicly shows; share only with cleared project maintainers",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any AWS resource or namespace named with `pro` or `production` as a whole segment — the project's single AWS environment is named `pro` (resources `bidsenseai-pro-<name>`), so treat all `bidsenseai-pro-*` AWS resources (Lambda, S3, Aurora, SQS, SSM, Secrets Manager) as production-sensitive despite the short name",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: the `pro` AWS environment for this project (all `bidsenseai-pro-*` resources) — this is the project's only environment, so all infra changes there are production changes",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: `infra/` OpenTofu state and resources targeting the `pro` environment (IAM, RDS/Aurora, S3, Lambda, SQS, EventBridge) — the SCP-restricted eu-north-1 region and `bidsenseai-pro-*` naming are the markers",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (DevOps/platform engineering — Terraform/OpenTofu, Kubernetes/Helm, CI/CD, Python automation per global CLAUDE.md)",
      "**Trusted repo**: `/Users/jlparis/personal/subastas-boe` (BidSense AI) and its `origin` remote `github-personal:XileonXL/bidsenseai.git` — visibility unverified, treat as private per shipped default but scope pushes conservatively",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: `tofu` (OpenTofu, used in place of `terraform`), `uv` (Python package/dependency manager), `aws` CLI with `AWS_PROFILE=bidsenseai`, `bidsenseai-db` (migration CLI), `cat-load` / `market-prices archive` (project data-loading CLIs)",
